-- US-3125: eight brands the KB did not have, plus colorways for ten.
--
-- The loop again, aimed at brands sellers hold that were absent entirely rather
-- than at brands already present with gaps. Catalogues read 2026-09-06 with
-- scripts/ops/shopify-brand-harvest.mjs.
--
-- -- THE NEW BRANDS ---------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Alice + Olivia, TravisMathew, Robert Graham, St. John, Sundry, Toad&Co,
-- Veronica Beard, David Donahue. Two carry an FTC-sourced registered number:
--
--     Alice + Olivia   RN 107677   ALICE + OLIVIA
--     TravisMathew     RN 123280   TRAVISMATHEW LLC
--
-- Both registrants ARE the label, which is the bar. The others return nothing
-- from the register (David Donahue, Robert Graham, Toad&Co) or return hits that
-- are not the brand -- "Sundry" gives UNIQUE & SUNDRY CREATIONS INC and AMY
-- PLYMAT, "St. John" gives five different St. John registrants with no product
-- line to separate them, and Veronica Beard gives Pipes & Shaw LLC whose name
-- contains nothing of the label. All refused rather than guessed.
--
-- These are MINIMAL brand rows: identity, category focus, RN where sourced.
-- tag_eras, country_patterns and authentication_tells are empty and every row
-- says so, because an unexplained empty column reads as "researched, nothing
-- found" and that is not what it means.
--
-- -- COLOURS ----------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Same rule as 00734: a colour on five or more products, a brand with at least
-- eight such colours and no more than 35%% plain colour words.
--
-- base_color and shade are filled in the SAME statement this time rather than a
-- follow-up pass, using the brand's own `wash::` / `color::` facet where it
-- publishes one (00738) and falling back to aspect-normalize's family table
-- (00737). NULL still means unresolved, never "no colour".
--
-- Seeded: aliceandolivia (399, 4%% plain), travismathew (120, 7%% plain), stjohn (16, 0%% plain), sundry (15, 13%% plain), toadandco (62, 5%% plain), veronicabeard (68, 19%% plain), beyondyoga (97, 2%% plain), johnnieo (70, 16%% plain).
-- Refused: robertgraham (32 colours, 62%% plain).
-- Refused: daviddonahue (13 colours, 54%% plain).
--

